WEBVTT

00:03:59.574 --> 00:04:02.899
is to prove he's a man and not a piano key.

00:04:02.899 --> 00:04:04.461
Over and over throughout history,

00:04:04.461 --> 00:04:06.449
people in power have used fear

00:04:06.449 --> 00:04:10.248
to silence the truth and to silence dissent.

00:04:10.248 --> 00:04:12.287
It's time we strike a new note.

00:04:12.287 --> 00:04:14.262
Thank you.

00:04:14.262 --> 00:04:16.116
(Applause)